        { "id": "b", "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "b",
      "explanation": "$\\cos 30° = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$. Note that $\\cos 30° = \\sin 60°$."
